    "repo": "system-comparison",
    "branch": "feature/ayu_develop",
    "status": "All six owned Python source files compile and all five existing framework benchmark scripts execute on the supplied common historical interval.",
    "runtime": "Root/Backtesting/Backtrader/VectorBT Python3.15.0; Basana/Nautilus Python3.14.8",
    "tests": "No supplied pytest test cases. Existing Backtesting.py, Backtrader, Basana, Nautilus and VectorBT benchmark smoke runs passed on the common 2024-01-01 to2024-01-02 sample.",
    "notes": "Basana\u2019s latest pycares source fails against this macOS SDK on3.15; current Nautilus native distribution requires3.14. The Nautilus script performs a manual SMA simulation using Nautilus data models; it does not run a full BacktestEngine. Latest compatible libraries are independently locked per framework. Existing bar API, numerical indexing, CLI percent escaping and basis-point cost conversion issues were fixed."
  },
  "note": "Full raw logs are retained in the workspace maintenance evidence, not distributed here. Hashes identify those original logs. A successful build or selected test subset does not imply a full test-suite pass. Commands containing <workspace> describe the original execution environment."
